    "body": "<h2 id=\"h_01JMMHHXNXBKNQMN0E44NNHHND\">You will learn</h2>\n<p>Learn how to find your recent exports by accessing the Downloads tab. Here, you'll see a list of all of your downloads from the last 30 days and can check the progress of any pending downloads.</p>\n<div class=\"bs-callout bs-callout-default\">\n<p>Only Klaviyo users with the <a href=\"https://help.klaviyo.com/hc/en-us/articles/115005231648\">Owner or Admin roles</a> can access the Downloads tab and export lists or segments.</p>\n</div>\n<h2 id=\"h_01JMMHHXNX3722GZ4Q659N4XVA\">Find your recent exports and downloads  </h2>\n<ol>\n<li>Click your organization name in the bottom left corner.</li>\n<li>Click <strong>Settings &gt; Other</strong>.</li>\n<li>Select <strong>Downloads</strong> to see a list of exports and downloads from your account within the last 30 days. The list is split into pages with 10 results per page.</li>\n<li>Click <strong>Download</strong> to the right of any export to re-download an item.<br><img src=\"https://klaviyo.zendesk.com/hc/article_attachments/34255048962075\" alt=\"Recent exports in Klaviyo\">\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"h_01JMMHHXNY9DHYP63Y3R6RQMJ2\">Additional resources</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://klaviyo.zendesk.com/hc/en-us/articles/360047399472\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Getting started with reporting</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://klaviyo.zendesk.com/hc/en-us/articles/115005246168\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">How to export all the people in your account</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://klaviyo.zendesk.com/hc/en-us/articles/115005078687\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">How to export a list or segment to a CSV file</a></li>\n</ul>",
    "user_segment_ids": []
  },
